WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.275
Pay attention to E A oh eight.

2
00:00:02.275 --> 00:00:05.705
Microsoft Learn says to
exclude the emergency accounts

3
00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.625
from the policies that
block or restrict sign-in.

4
00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:11.775
The code doesn't try to
judge which policies do that.

5
00:00:11.775 --> 00:00:17.250
It checks every enforced policy, and that
choice is this workbook's design guidance.

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.186
An enforced policy that doesn't
exclude an emergency account,

7
00:00:21.186 --> 00:00:23.888
through the group or
directly, is a finding.

8
00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:28.287
A report-only policy that doesn't
exclude the group is only Info.

9
00:00:28.287 --> 00:00:32.476
Microsoft Learn says report-only
policies need no exclusion.

10
00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:36.425
But the exclusion is required
before the policy is enforced.

11
00:00:36.425 --> 00:00:41.447
And the program's own pre-merge check,
which Module 3 builds, is stricter:

12
00:00:41.447 --> 00:00:45.950
it wants the exclusion on every
policy file, whatever its state.

13
00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.140
Module 3 comes back to this.
